; RIFT BOSS POOL (sl-0180 wave 1A; REBUILT sl-0187+0188): Ring Nest —
; grade 1, nebula pool. PLACEHOLDER descriptive id (designer's fish
; designs re-skin later; identity data-keyed). ROOM-PATTERN family
; (sl-0188): ANCHOR — the boss holds its ground and the nested rings
; + offset rings FILL THE ROOM regardless of where the player
; stands (the choreography IS the fight; the standing-there statue
; is dead because the show never stops). hp 360 = 30s at the g1
; spine (sl-0187: 20-60s INTENSE; cooldowns compressed ~x0.67).
; Every emitter telegraph == its pattern's ONE lead (mechanized
; law); elite amber; every number [T]. Fight length gated by
; balance_calc GATE 7.

